            "name": "ticket_api",
            "description": "Zammad tickets for API clients such as the Assistant. All calls are made with the user's own Zammad token, so Zammad decides which tickets and articles, internal notes included, a user may see. Notes the Assistant writes end with a footer block: an empty line, a line \"---\" and a line starting with \"Nextcloud Assistant for \". The block is a contract. Earlier notes are recognized by it, so changing it breaks the duplicate check and the assistant_note flag for every note written before the change."
